## Original Content
<p>In addition to data protection, the EU’s General Data Protection Regulation requires businesses to ensure consumers can exercise their data privacy rights. But first, individuals must know these rights.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://gdpr.eu/consumers-gdpr-data-privacy-rights/">Do consumers know their GDPR data privacy rights?</a> appeared first on <a href="https://gdpr.eu">GDPR.eu</a>.</p>

## Summary
The EU's General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) requires businesses to ensure consumers can exercise their data privacy rights, but individuals must first be aware of these rights. This article discusses consumer knowledge of GDPR data privacy rights.

## Key Points
- GDPR mandates businesses to allow consumers to exercise data privacy rights.
- Consumer awareness is necessary for individuals to exercise these rights.
- The article explores whether consumers know their GDPR rights.


